Use in Flopwire:
- internal/retrieval/regexq/plan.go ports index/regexp.go (RegexpQuery: the
  regular expression to trigram query planner). The file header names the
  source path and commit and lists the changes: trigrams are counted in
  Unicode characters (SQLite FTS5 trigram tokens) instead of bytes, literals
  and classes are folded to the index's case-insensitive form, and set and
  query operations no longer share backing storage.
